  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Use your ki to guide your blows to make an unarmed strike or use a natural weapon against your foe more accurately or as a touch attack.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Str 13, Wis 13, base attack bonus +5, either Improved Unarmed Strike or a natural weapon.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While maintaining ki focus, your unarmed strike or attacks with a natural weapon gains a +1 insight bonus to hit for every 2 ki points invested.</p>\n<p>By expending your ki focus with a single unarmed strike or attack with a natural weapon, you can resolve it as a touch attack. You must decide to expend your ki focus prior to making the attack. If your attack misses, you still expend your ki focus and any ki points invested.</p>\n<p>You gain one point of ki.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
